WEBVTT

00:00:02.204 --> 00:00:05.444
There are seven more spheres of the dragon.

00:00:11.068 --> 00:00:15.768
It seems that there is a terrible battle in progress at the Supreme Palace, where we are leading.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.380
I know very well!

00:00:17.408 --> 00:00:21.368
But this will not prevent us from finishing our mission, I tell you!

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:43.700
Supreme!

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:49.300
This room was created specifically for them, but it seems to me that now they are exaggerating!

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:54.180
Everything is falling apart!

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:58.120
Whatever you are in, they are our affairs, you will proceed!

00:01:02.556 --> 00:01:03.556
I was allowed to enter

00:01:07.068 --> 00:01:08.268
Ultima Swarm!

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:37.800
I didn't know we shouldn't have trusted them!

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:39.330
They'll destroy everything!

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:49.850
Here we are! Everybody in their place!

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:51.350
To the orders!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.040
Tremendous!

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.840
All right, Pilaf?

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:04.160
What the hell happened?

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:12.880
It is unheard of after years of research and after shedding tears and sweat, working day and night with constant commitment!

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:18.780
I discovered that there are new powerful spheres of the dragon and that they are under my nose!

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:21.550
We can't give up right now!

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:23.040
Oh, come on, let's proceed!

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:25.970
In action!

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:27.410
Phase number two!

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:29.890
Those spheres must be ours at any-

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:50.880
We're done, Dende.

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:53.910
Well, at this point, I'd say Uba passed the exam.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:57.350
No, it wasn't an exam, it was just the end of the training.

00:02:57.830 --> 00:02:59.970
I was curious to see the result of-

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:04.700
my teachings and so I tried to fight with him. So, did you have fun a little, son?

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:14.470
Yes, a lot. What's wrong? Do you feel bad? This priest, we must cure him immediately.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:27.300
Okay. I found the spheres, look how beautiful they are. Are you sure these are the famous

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.730
spheres of the dragon? There is not.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:30.420
No doubt.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:31.240
Look!

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:33.620
A blue star!

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:34.300
What does it mean?

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:36.780
I don't want to be wrong, but I remember that the stars were red.

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:37.400
Exactly!

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:40.660
But the appearance is not the only thing that differentiates them from the others.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:45.800
You know, it is very likely that these are the spheres that the ancient supreme of the earth created

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:48.620
before his evil side detached from him.

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:55.940
Don't you think they are fantastic?

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:02.880
What are those faces?

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.690
Excuse me, who is it that has detached?

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:07.830
Mom!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.560
Everything's fine, boss!

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:21.320
In short, these spheres were created before the power of the previous Supreme was divided into two parts!

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:25.280
When there was still a single being, its powers had the maximum intensity!

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:29.040
Are you serious?

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:35.980
So it means that these new spheres of the dragon could be much more powerful than the others, right?

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:37.120
Give it to me right now!

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:39.200
I see you finally got it!

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:41.980
And now, come on, take all seven!

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:43.640
Yes sir, at your service!

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:48.280
But how? Are you already coming home?

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:51.810
Yes, unfortunately I have to take care of my brothers and sisters.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:56.340
You know, I feel a little guilty about leaving the palace in these conditions.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.680
Don't worry, Popo will think about fixing everything.

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:05.280
You did well to fight here, who knows what disaster you would have combined if you were trained on Earth.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:10.960
Goodbye Goku, thank you for everything. I will always be a great friend.

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:18.170
You too. It was a great pleasure to train you. You are a very special boy. Never change, got it?

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:18.770
All right.

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:21.320
See you soon and take care of yourself.

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:24.640
I will. Goodbye and thank you again for everything.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:47.930
How many years of waiting and suffering! Here we are finally at the great moment! Our desire to conquer is about to happen!

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:52.390
I don't want to be pessimistic, but...

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:59.730
...was it a mistake or has it always been a characteristic of ours to always come interrupted right when we are one step away from completion?

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:00.860
of our missions.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.140
No, you're not wrong.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.020
So let's move.

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:07.280
What a nice meal, guys.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.300
It will be better if I go too.

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:11.360
But how? Already?

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:13.380
Perfect, I'm ready.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:26.370
See you.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:28.290
You know, it's enough that I don't make myself

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:29.410
more alive at home and I don't want

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:29.750
that ...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.280
If you get too angry with me...

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:58.100
What do you want?

00:06:59.030 --> 00:06:59.170
Milk!

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:07.810
Hey, what are you doing here?

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:12.630
Oh no!

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:16.080
What do you want?

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:20.790
Hey, wait a minute, I know you!

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:22.420
You are Pilar!

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:25.890
I guessed, right?

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:29.590
Of course it's been a while!

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.570
Who is that guy? Do you know him?

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:35.530
Boss, it's Goku! How can you not remember him?

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:37.450
What did you say, Goku?

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:43.160
That ugly dickhead who sent Mount a thousand times our attempts to conquer the universe!

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.240
Yes, that's right, it's him!

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:49.220
And he looks even more muscular than the last time we saw him.

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:50.140
Hmm, you say?

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:53.540
Take me out of curiosity, what are you doing here at the Supreme Palace?

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.930
Oh, nothing special, just a little walk.

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:57.030
Hey!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.260
How could it be nothing special?

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:04.480
I've just seen a dazzling light coming from this side.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:07.320
We've been discovered! Fire!

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:23.070
I see that over time you haven't changed at all, guys.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.410
What the hell?

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.510
I should have stopped him.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:34.600
A little kid like this again? At least we wouldn't have had him between our legs!

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:37.580
Come on, confess! You have something in mind about Losko, don't you?

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:38.480
Don't get any closer!

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:43.830
If you were a fly, I would cut you into pieces and then I would crush you until you became a bunch of dust!

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:49.620
Agreed. As you wish.

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:51.920
Eh?

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:02.490
Goku! Goku!

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:15.210
What's happening, Goku?

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:23.820
I'm sorry.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.260
It's not possible, Goku!

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:28.750
It's done.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.260
As you can see, I have fulfilled your wish.

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:35.120
Well, now I have to go.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:53.120
Oh, it's not fair! Once again my plan failed!

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:58.190
Why did I become a child again? I don't understand!

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:16.000
Have other spheres of the dragon been used?

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:18.180
Yes, unfortunately it is so.

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:21.580
I can't believe they were found.

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:28.440
They were created before the previous supreme was divided into two and since then they have remained here in the palace.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:31.830
What a mess! And now what do we do?

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.760
Open your ears well, Goku!

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:37.040
The only way to get you back to adulthood

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:39.380
is to gather the spheres with the dark stars again

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:42.180
and express another wish in front of the dragon Charon,

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:42.520
do you understand?

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.980
Perfectly! It does not seem very difficult to me,

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:50.080
that if I have to admit that I would not be sorry at all to remain a child.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.400
It's not as simple as you think.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:55.240
The normal spheres scatter on the planet

00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:57.260
on which the desire has been expressed.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:59.900
These, on the other hand, start in the direction of the four...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:04.180
East, west, north and south, crossing the entire universe.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.000
It's not easy to gather them.

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:07.640
Popo is right, son!

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:17.390
Yes, I understand. It's nothing, I like to be like this.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:18.650
I'm going home, bye!

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:19.290
One moment!

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:19.910
Goku!

00:11:20.190 --> 00:11:22.340
Too late, he's gone.

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:26.480
It's useless, that boy will never change.

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:35.870
Go back! Go back!

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:39.680
If you try to approach, I'll shoot at the hostage! Stay back!

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:52.520
Take care of a car, an airplane and four boxes of spaghetti ready!

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:05.200
Okay, we got it, we'll do as you say, but please, stop shooting!

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:19.780
Well, guys, what do you say if I offer you a nice ice cream, eh?

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:26.000
You know, it seems like a dream to me. I never thought you'd agree to go out with me.

00:12:26.530 --> 00:12:29.970
You've been very kind to have asked me, I really like being-

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:34.640
You're the sweetest girl we've ever met.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.640
Don't you think you're exaggerating a bit?

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:38.460
No, not at all.

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.830
You said you were going to the movies.

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:45.790
A beautiful western just came out.

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:49.420
I want to see this.

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:54.430
We're bringing the spaghetti in the box, as you asked.

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:55.190
Don't shoot!

00:12:57.760 --> 00:12:59.340
We'll make our friend taste them first.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.080
just to make sure you don't poison us.

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:02.540
What?

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:04.820
At the cinema!

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:08.940
No, I'm sorry, this area is currently closed to the public.

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.480
Come on, go back home, come on!

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:12.660
It's very dangerous to stay here.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:18.400
I suspected it, well!

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:21.060
At this point I just have to change hostages.

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:22.950
What a scoundrel!

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:25.510
You wanted to give us spaghetti al sonnifero, eh?

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:29.970
Okay, okay, we got it!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:33.660
I understand, no more jokes, we will do as you want, but please, free the girl!

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:38.260
But do you know that she is really very cute?

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:46.300
You know, Paul, it seems the time to do the Don Giovanni with a robbery in progress.

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:49.510
What? What robbery am I talking about?

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:17.330
Go home!

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:32.940
You are ruining my date with my friend!

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:35.490
What? But she's just a child!

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:38.040
Come on, you have now freed that girl, courage!

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:44.570
Mocho!

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:47.940
I taught you how to be polite!

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:53.920
Hosting people is a bad thing!

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:57.220
Listen a little, a child who preaches to four adults!

00:14:57.560 --> 00:14:59.940
Go back to your mother's house, here you could do...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:04.750
I would never believe it, but I swear I'm much older than I look.

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:07.830
Who do you want to take a ride?

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:09.700
Come on!

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:17.260
I realize that for a child of your age it is very dangerous to be in a place like this.

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:19.460
They could have seriously injured you, you know?

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:21.530
Oh yes, but ...

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:24.230
Nothing, but let me think about it, to fix the matter.

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:26.610
These are big things, I explained myself.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:28.960
Now do the good and go home right away.

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:38.300
I told you to be careful!

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:15.750
Excuse me, I...

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.160
What's up?

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:21.120
I just remembered an urgent commission I need to take care of.

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:22.340
Bye bye!

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:38.330
Hello, Pan!

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:44.770
Excuse me, excuse me, excuse me...

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:45.690
How are you, little one?

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:56.310
Oh, excuse me...

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.970
It's always nice to come to the city and be surrounded by a lot of...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:00.620
Beautiful girls!

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:03.800
It was so much that I did not have fun like this!

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:05.400
Stop making yourself ridiculous!

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:06.980
Do not you see that everyone is looking at you?

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:08.830
Oh, but how many stories!

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:10.910
In the end he's not doing anything wrong, right?

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:17.860
You changed a comma, huh, genius?

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:20.660
What? What a strange mistake!

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:22.440
I've already seen you somewhere, boy!

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:24.920
No, genius, you're not wrong at all!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:25.640
I'm Goku!

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:28.280
What do you say?

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:29.430
Goku?

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:34.270
It's true, now that I think about it, he looks a lot like him.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:37.810
Goku, it can't be true!

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:45.430
Of course, it's really you!

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:47.210
You finally came back home!

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:49.690
It's been years since I wanted to hug you again!

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:53.380
It's not possible!

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:54.240
It's absurd!

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:56.240
That little boy can't be Goku!

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:59.830
Tell me something, son.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.900
Am I wrong or are you a little bit younger than when you left us?

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:07.200
Yeah, Pilaf expressed a wish with the dragon sphere and made me come back as a child.

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:07.920
Oh no!

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:12.070
I refuse to believe it, it's not true, it's not true!

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:15.310
By the way, how are Kiki and the boys? Is everything all right?

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:17.310
Yes, yes, don't worry, they're fine.

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:22.570
Tell me, are you really my grandfather Goku?

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:26.600
You're Pan, my great-granddaughter!

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:28.750
Wait a minute, how could it be?

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:32.610
Were you here without knowing who was one and who was the other?

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:35.070
Well, now I'll explain why you're so strong!

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:37.050
Of course you grew up, eh!

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:45.100
Oh, dad, something terrible happened to you!

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.140
Let's not exaggerate, it's not the end of the world!

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:50.720
The only strange thing is that everything seems much smaller than it was before!

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:55.020
I can't believe that my grandfather has become a child smaller than me!

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:59.610
And what do I do to not get old and always stay in shape?

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:03.490
It will be one of your usual jokes to make me angry, right?

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:06.650
It's not a joke, darling, believe me!

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:11.260
Sorry if I interrupt, but don't you think you should look for the Dragon Balls to go back to how you were before?

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:14.280
Yes, maybe you're right.

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:20.600
If you summon the Dragon Chiron again, you could express the desire to go back to adulthood, right?

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:24.500
I don't understand what you're waiting for, maybe you have any other game in mind?

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.620
Goku! Can you hear me?

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:34.700
Yes, it's me!

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:42.540
Listen to me, after what happened to you, I discovered a very important thing about the spheres.

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:44.520
Oh, really? What is it?

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:50.100
If you don't recover the spheres of the dragon with the black star within a year from the day the wish has been expressed,

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:54.080
the planet used to summon the dragon will disappear forever!

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:55.260
What?!

00:20:07.932 --> 00:20:08.932
It's terrible!

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:14.100
So if we can't find the spheres within a year from now, the Earth will be...

00:20:15.068 --> 00:20:16.908
It will be erased forever!

00:20:29.084 --> 00:20:29.984
the new Strasbourg

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:33.380
The ordinary adventure of the legendary Goku is about to begin.

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:39.780
It is a fantastic story that none of you have ever seen and that no one can imagine.
